# PR quality gate

**Why:** Catching lint/test/style issues before review saves everyone time.

## Required

Before `repo_open_pr`:

```
devkit → action: pre_pr_quality_gate, repoPath: <repo>
```

Only open PR when **`verdict`** is **`ready`**.

## Fix order

1. Blockers (lint fail, test fail, critical heuristics)
2. Warnings (large diff, missing tests, style drift)
3. Re-run gate

